    Executive: Sentinel git-probe bounded retry + timeout/error distinction (assignment A)
    
    Fix the load-induced false government_git_unreadable artifact
    (records/SENTINEL-CALIBRATION-2026-10-21-git-unreadable-under-load.md):
    - git_probe retries a read-only Git timeout a bounded number of times with
      backoff before declaring unreadable; a genuine Git error is not retried;
    - a persistent timeout adds a distinct government_git_probe_timeout signal;
      a recovered slow probe emits no signal (logged to stderr);
    - detection unchanged: all attempts failing still emit
      government_git_unreadable / government_git_refs_unavailable.
    Test: tests/sentinel-git-probe-smoke.sh (hermetic). Full suite green.

